<title>POLAND: POLFA KUTNO MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLFA KUTNO MAY NET FALLS TO PLN 1.3 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results May </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MAY			1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.31 vs   1.54</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.85 vs   2.43</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.01 vs   2.95</p>
<p> Sales		   16.25 vs  13.48</p>
<p> JANUARY-MAY	    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.28 vs   7.67</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	13.01 vs  11.59</p>
<p> Operating profit    13.48 vs  12.92</p>
<p> Sales		   86.72 vs  73.96</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish drug maker is Kutnowskie Zaklady</p>
<p>Farmaceutyczne Polfa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
